Subject: [PATCH] Enforce dynamic Worker CPU budgets through isolated hooks

Move v27 CPU monitoring, request accounting, isolate revocation and out-of-loop culprit reporting into Coworkerd files. Read validated COWORKERD_CPU_LIMIT_MS and COWORKERD_CPU_STATE without changing the Rust CLI. Preserve upstream null-limit defaults through delegation. Required by Coworkerd v27-v29 and the v28 quarantine pool. Upstream status: Coworkerd-specific; not submitted.

